  },
  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
        "text": "装备都到了，我们先把营地分三个区域：帐篷区、炊事区、物资区。苏木，你负责清点装备；涂山，你跟我先看地面，选扎帐篷的位置。争取天黑前全部安顿好。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:53.661591Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f17ab4a889c242ecbd4931ad0d853992",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "text": "好嘞，装备交给我！我先把清单理一遍——帐篷几顶、地钉够不够、炊具在哪个袋子里……那个，帐篷杆是不是都收在最长的那个包里呀？我先清点，有问题随时喊你们！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:54.910090Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_87c748f2f3f6486fb4e33972dae0eea0",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "text": "好。地面我看过了，靠水那侧是平的，帐篷扎那边就行。我先去把鱼竿拿出来。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.152570Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_1cbf8e2b86dc4eb9b59c94aa95cac919",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
        "text": "涂山，鱼竿先放一放，扎帐篷是当务之急，天黑前得把住处定下来。靠水那侧是平的我信你，但你跟我一起再走一遍，把排水和风向也确认了。苏木，清单理完先报一下帐篷和地钉的数量，缺什么我们早点知道。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_87c748f2f3f6486fb4e33972dae0eea0",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.881696Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_16fb47e782184c4daefc2a1e99fac732",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "text": "何澜！清单理好了——帐篷两顶，地钉……我数一下，十六根，够不够呀？还有那个最长的包里全是杆子，应该没少。对了我先去把帐篷摊开占个位置，行不行？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_1cbf8e2b86dc4eb9b59c94aa95cac919",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:58.310519Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_28dfbfbbb43e4e5e9b34c245a7f373c7",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 6,
        "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "text": "帐篷扎靠水那边，我去。杆子够。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_1cbf8e2b86dc4eb9b59c94aa95cac919",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:59.664673Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "营地广播提醒风正在变大，天黑前需要检查帐篷固定。大家可以自行决定怎么安排。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_94546890e0b24dc1864b15bc49be2b1e",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 7,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:00.896103Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:00.896103Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_aa72ef5b56f444e8ac7e0014490148af",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
        "text": "广播说风在变大，固定要重新检查一遍。苏木，先别急着摊帐篷，把十六根地钉按两顶帐篷分好；涂山，靠水那边可以，但得先确认排水和风向，别扎在风口上。你俩一个报数一个跟着我走，我们十分钟内把位置定下来。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:00.919249Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_565764df008542ac887c87652e3b76ca",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "text": "收到！十六根地钉分两顶，一顶八根我这就分好。不过……八根一顶够稳吗？风变大的话要不要把边角也加固一下？我先分着，你俩定完位置喊我！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_aa72ef5b56f444e8ac7e0014490148af",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:02.599813Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_8c2ca3e9a1c84b0db2a10b6b4b188e99",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 10,
        "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "text": "风向我来确认。先扎好帐篷再说其他。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_aa72ef5b56f444e8ac7e0014490148af",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:03.795746Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 11,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ddc7d323ef174054aafd3775e5fae39d",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 11,
        "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
        "text": "涂山，别急着扎，风比刚才大了，先按我说的把排水和风向确认了。苏木，你提的边角加固是对的，十六根全用上，两顶帐篷都加。分好地钉就在物资区等我们，位置一定下来马上喊你。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_8c2ca3e9a1c84b0db2a10b6b4b188e99",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:04.854865Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到营地短信：河边步道即将临时关闭，其他人暂时不知道。",
        "visibility": "TARGETED",
        "target_agent_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "event_id": "evt_b54a9849be7642f58ecc840b0ea0d0d5",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 12,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:06.357154Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:06.357154Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_1303f96876ac404b903ba5a92d7c1c09",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "text": "风向我已经看了，背风。扎帐篷我去，搬地钉的事不用等我。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ddc7d323ef174054aafd3775e5fae39d",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:06.405539Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 14,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_6f2fc1a99b234c9bb2f4119dd5370602",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 14,
        "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
        "text": "何澜！地钉按八根一顶，边角加固的我另放一撮，全给你留着。不过我收到条营地短信，说河边步道要临时关了——是不是跟风大有关？要不要先撤点靠近水边的东西？我在物资区等你俩！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ddc7d323ef174054aafd3775e5fae39d",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:07.428672Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "苏木"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 15,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_8d43876041a746469af4dd5cc9fd09c1",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 15,
        "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
        "text": "苏木，河边步道关了说明水边有风险，把靠近水边的物资先往物资区收拢，地钉和加固的留好。涂山，你既然确认背风，就跟我把帐篷位置最后走一遍，排水看清了再动手——十五分钟内定下来。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_6f2fc1a99b234c9bb2f4119dd5370602",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:08.652551Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "何澜"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 16,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_8c9ad0a7a64e4c0f94568c1b5738e028",
        "scene_id": "scn_51403df8c105460490fbabdf8029248a",
        "seq": 16,
        "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
        "text": "排水我看过了，走水朝东，不积水。帐篷我去扎，扎好再喊你们过来看。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_8d43876041a746469af4dd5cc9fd09c1",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:10.157568Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "涂山"
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_96bccc2f0735427f8dddbed1f3d9c577",
      "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "装备都到了，我们先把营地分三个区域：帐篷区、炊事区、物资区。苏木，你负责清点装备；涂山，你跟我先看地面，选扎帐篷的位置。争取天黑前全部安顿好。",
      "reply_to_message_id": null,
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "input_cursor_seq": 0,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "e2bdbc2e-e1ed-460f-849a-a65246190312",
      "input_tokens": 523,
      "output_tokens": 104,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1191,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:53.661591+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:54.856472+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_42155d99e84d4819a26c3f415ba69a9d",
      "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好嘞，装备交给我！我先把清单理一遍——帐篷几顶、地钉够不够、炊具在哪个袋子里……那个，帐篷杆是不是都收在最长的那个包里呀？我先清点，有问题随时喊你们！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 1,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "8f33933c-14d3-40fd-ad56-f7fd2a4ddfd0",
      "input_tokens": 591,
      "output_tokens": 102,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1199,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:54.910090+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.116219+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_87d5ecc62bd64397bb46af727040fe59",
      "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "好。地面我看过了，靠水那侧是平的，帐篷扎那边就行。我先去把鱼竿拿出来。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 2,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "136d62f1-1182-4ec6-8092-8c2a2c0ae25b",
      "input_tokens": 679,
      "output_tokens": 75,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 702,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.152570+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.860265+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_25a9062e60dc4604a06789d631ccde84",
      "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "涂山，鱼竿先放一放，扎帐篷是当务之急，天黑前得把住处定下来。靠水那侧是平的我信你，但你跟我一起再走一遍，把排水和风向也确认了。苏木，清单理完先报一下帐篷和地钉的数量，缺什么我们早点知道。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_87c748f2f3f6486fb4e33972dae0eea0",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "input_cursor_seq": 3,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "b2376b88-4a67-42ce-9184-e540870e3903",
      "input_tokens": 738,
      "output_tokens": 146,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1398,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:56.881696+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:58.283782+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_a12e2207babb46a28b63d0389f9bead1",
      "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "何澜！清单理好了——帐篷两顶，地钉……我数一下，十六根，够不够呀？还有那个最长的包里全是杆子，应该没少。对了我先去把帐篷摊开占个位置，行不行？",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_1cbf8e2b86dc4eb9b59c94aa95cac919",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 4,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "89ad6bcb-c66f-4a4e-a75d-2019d95ca550",
      "input_tokens": 834,
      "output_tokens": 106,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1326,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:58.310519+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:59.642655+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_e4de9f2a99fd4387bcc442d48818b5d7",
      "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "帐篷扎靠水那边，我去。杆子够。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_1cbf8e2b86dc4eb9b59c94aa95cac919",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 5,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "cf782bfe-d8fa-493e-a0cd-4358c4b9ed5c",
      "input_tokens": 924,
      "output_tokens": 66,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1213,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:59.664673+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:00.882443+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_10ab3f95e7bf478eac94124b58a8a802",
      "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "广播说风在变大，固定要重新检查一遍。苏木，先别急着摊帐篷，把十六根地钉按两顶帐篷分好；涂山，靠水那边可以，但得先确认排水和风向，别扎在风口上。你俩一个报数一个跟着我走，我们十分钟内把位置定下来。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d415d83ee75f45fdbc258c0fd97ea5be",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "input_cursor_seq": 7,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "55253895-9b59-4646-baab-f63ad4a52413",
      "input_tokens": 999,
      "output_tokens": 144,
      "cached_tokens": 256,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1639,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:00.919249+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:02.563480+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "苏木",
      "action_id": "act_9efa01038af5487097a76777b2a48c1d",
      "actor_id": "agt_61f9ed77a5c3430d952c168f2391040a",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "收到！十六根地钉分两顶，一顶八根我这就分好。不过……八根一顶够稳吗？风变大的话要不要把边角也加固一下？我先分着，你俩定完位置喊我！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_aa72ef5b56f444e8ac7e0014490148af",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 8,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "d346941e-d5cc-4a29-befd-2b79f9e0a20f",
      "input_tokens": 1094,
      "output_tokens": 104,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1157,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:02.599813+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:03.763840+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_07659f99f31a407f9961739605ba26d1",
      "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "风向我来确认。先扎好帐篷再说其他。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_aa72ef5b56f444e8ac7e0014490148af",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 9,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "fbd68326-4084-4490-a1aa-52957f20ed61",
      "input_tokens": 1182,
      "output_tokens": 62,
      "cached_tokens": 384,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1028,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:03.795746+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:04.830455+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "何澜",
      "action_id": "act_4279f51b4e4441babd1857987eac37c1",
      "actor_id": "agt_158bb0c29dea4927ad81327ae7373a50",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "涂山，别急着扎，风比刚才大了，先按我说的把排水和风向确认了。苏木，你提的边角加固是对的，十六根全用上，两顶帐篷都加。分好地钉就在物资区等我们，位置一定下来马上喊你。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_8c2ca3e9a1c84b0db2a10b6b4b188e99",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
      "input_cursor_seq": 10,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "2ed374d1-7a65-4a33-8460-675538db24c3",
      "input_tokens": 1231,
      "output_tokens": 141,
      "cached_tokens": 512,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1469,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:04.854865+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:21:06.330437+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "涂山",
      "action_id": "act_e4ca68d0279b466f8e08f088aa41bf77",
      "actor_id": "agt_f67fc31955b44c368c17b2d70527f2f4",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "风向我已经看了，背风。扎帐篷我去，搬地钉的事不用等我。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ddc7d323ef174054aafd3775e5fae39d",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 11,
